		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Brass automaton with a single orb-eye. Filled with humming gears, levers, pistons, and machinery.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 energy drill +3 (2d6) or 1 laser torch (near) +3 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow, climb, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Delicate Machinery</strong>. Critical hits against robot do an extra die of damage. Takes double damage from lightning.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shape Terrain</strong>. Over 1d4 rounds, create a far-length tunnel, a near-length wall, or other terrain alteration.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
